The background command from my first attempt was stopped. It hung because `git shortlog` waits on stdin when it isn't given a revision. I reran the same lookups with `HEAD` and `</dev/null`, and they finished. The answer I gave you came from that rerun, so it doesn't change.

My recommendation was Troy Goode as the main reviewer, with Douglas Christopher Wilson added for larger changes. There's no CODEOWNERS file in the repo.

