|---|---|---|---|
| Troy Goode | 144 (67.3%) | 159 (66.8%) | 2026-04-10, active |
| Douglas Christopher Wilson | 20 (9.3%) | 22 (9.2%) | 2017-10-04, inactive |
| Alejandro Caravaca Puchades | 14 (6.5%) | 16 (6.7%) | 2015-05-28, inactive |

- **Troy Goode, the first reviewer:**
  - The 144 lines count `<email redacted>` and `troy@laptop.example` as one person. Counted separately, it's 132 lines (61.7%) and 12 lines (5.6%), and only the laptop address has a recent commit. The tool rates the match as strong, but it's a guess from names and addresses, and nothing is written to `.mailmap`.
  - They are the top owner of the file, at 67.3% of non-blank lines.
  - They are the only one of the 18 authors of this file who committed in the year before 2026-04-12.
  - The bus factor for this file is 1, so Troy Goode alone holds more than half the lines.
- **Douglas Christopher Wilson, the second reviewer, if you want one:**
  - They hold 9.3% of the lines. They have no commit at this path since 2017-10-04, though their last commit anywhere was 2021-09-07. They have left this file, not the project.
  - No other author holds more than a few lines. The tool shows no file where Wilson holds half or more, and it lists no file that only one person has written.
- **Alejandro Caravaca Puchades:**
  - Their 14 lines are credited to them even though Troy Goode committed them (commit e64e854, "Allow array of matching conditions as options.origin"). The same person also appears as `alex94puchades` on the same address.
  - They are inactive at this path, with a last commit of 2015-05-28.

I checked who wrote the surviving lines. I did not check who understands the code. Commit fcd2b56 ("issue #42: (WIP) switch to ESLint; clean up") looks mechanical, but the tool did not set it aside. It touches 6 surviving lines, so the shares barely change.

To get reviewers based on the diff itself, run `--for-diff main...HEAD` once you've made the change. It lists the people who wrote the lines you replace or delete. New files and pure insertions have no earlier owner.

